Package: n2a
Type: Package
Title: Import and Dose-Response Analysis for N2a Assay Data
Version: 0.2.0
Author: Synne Thorbjørnsen Frøstrup
Maintainer: Synne Thorbjørnsen Frøstrup <synne.frostrup@bfr.bund.de>
Description: R package for streamlined, standardized analysis of data from the Neuro-2a (N2a) cell-based assay. Includes functions for importing raw data from both '.txt' and '.xlsx' files, performing dose-response analysis using the 4PL model with programmatic access to the fitted parameters, and generating formatted analysis reports.
License: GPL-2
Imports:
  readxl,
  numDeriv,
  utils,
  graphics,
  stats
Suggests: 
  rmarkdown,
  knitr
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
Encoding: UTF-8
